{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36185","headline":"送朱二十赴涟水 · 方干","name":"送朱二十赴涟水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"到县却应嫌水阔，离家终是见山疎。\n笙歌不驻难辞酒，舟檝将行负担书。\n爲政必能安楚老，向公犹可钓淮鱼。\n鸾凰取便多如此，掠地斜飞上太虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}